            "I use a diagnostic-then-relearn-then-check sequence rather than immediately assigning many practice problems, to target actual errors and avoid wasted effort.",
            "The plan can finish in fewer than 14 days; the window is a maximum lookahead, not a required duration."
          ],
          "unresolvedUncertainty": [
            "The exact five circuits and errors from the previous check are not supplied; the learner must reconstruct equivalent changed problems from their course.",
            "It is unknown which specific methods the course has taught; the learner must confirm this before selecting problems."
          ],
          "stoppingConditions": [
            "Stop when five new changed circuits are solved independently with correct method choice, valid selection reasons and correct checked solutions.",
